<b>Choose Your Farmer:</b> Select Leo or Clara and start on Day 1 with 150G, three basic tools (Hoe, Watering Can, Scythe), and starter seeds.<br>  

<b>Cultivate Crops:</b> Till the soil, plant seeds, water them (to grow 1.8× faster), and harvest mature crops (Turnip, Wheat, Carrot, Strawberry, Tomato).<br>  

<b>Care for Animals:</b> Pet Cows and Chickens in the top-right pasture to collect Strawberry Milk (50G) and Farm Fresh Eggs (28G).<br>  

<b>Buy & Sell at the Shop (B):</b> Sell harvested crops and animal goods for Gold, buy more seeds, and unlock 3 permanent upgrades (Winged Boots for +35% speed, Golden Watering Can for 3×3 watering, and Lucky Harvest Bell for +1 bonus crop per harvest).<br>  

<b>Barn Storage & Saving (C / F5):</b> Transfer items between your Backpack (18 slots) and Barn Storage (24 slots), and save your progress anytime using the Barn menu or F5.
